<title>NETHERLANDS: NATWEST MARKETS OPENS AMSTERDAM OFFICE.</title>
<headline>NATWEST MARKETS OPENS AMSTERDAM OFFICE.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Natwest Markets said on Tuesday it had opened an office in Amsterdam.</p>
<p>But all Dutch equities trading will continue out of Natwest Markets' London office, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Natwest Markets is the corporate and investing banking arm of Natwest Group. It was admitted as a remote member of the Amsterdam stock exchange in February 1997.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
